    "summary": "At your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) opening, make the army’s [Combat Drugs](vsdata:ability/drukhari.spectacle-of-spite.combat-drugs) selection first. The bearer’s unit then gets the D6 result from a separate lookup on the [Combat Drugs](vsdata:ability/drukhari.spectacle-of-spite.combat-drugs) table. It expires when your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) opens. An already active army result gives the unit no further effect if the extra roll repeats it.",
